  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK will provide &#xa3;25m to the Guinea Worm Eradication Programme to coordinate efforts to control and eradicate Guinea Worm Disease. The Carter Center, in conjunction with WHO, lead the GWEP.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity The UK will provide &#xa3;25m to the Guinea Worm Eradication Programme to coordinate efforts to control and eradicate Guinea Worm Disease. The Carter Center, in conjunction with WHO, lead the GWEP.  is a component of Eradication of Guinea Worm Disease Programme (2018-2022)  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;15,575,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control.</narrative>
  </description>
